  "story": {
    "day": 133,
    "title": "Kaya's New Plan",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was fourteen years old.",
      "A few days ago, she felt so happy.",
      "She planned an amusement park trip.",
      "But on the fourteenth, bad news appeared.",
      "The park would close for repairs. Kaya was scared.",
      "Her friend, Ren, was also sick and absent.",
      "Kaya felt a little angry. The fun day had to stop.",
      "\"Let's cycle to the public bowling center!\" she asked her own friends.",
      "They quickly cycled there and arrived.",
      "They were thirsty, but they saw a funny rule.",
